1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,570
Hi, Mark.

2
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:05,510
I've been trying to contact you by e-mail, but for some reason you have not responded.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:08,870
This is Julie, the secretary of the Choral Society.

4
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:11,150
I hope you receive this message in time.

5
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:14,270
We've had to cancel tonight's rehearsal at the last minute.

6
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:21,150
If for some reason you don't get this message tonight, I apologize—there won't be anybody else at the hall this evening.

7
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:30,650
I hope you understand that our conductor is unable to attend because of some urgent family business, and we've decided to postpone the rehearsal until next week.

8
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:36,415
I can't really give you any more details at the moment, but I'll let you know in the next few days.

9
00:00:36,555 --> 00:00:37,090
See you soon.
